{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":386588,"name":"Cardano Foundation","username":"Cardano-Foundation","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cardano.org/cardano-foundation/{size}/86489_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-12T08:33:19.251Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex023/uploads/cardano/original/3X/c/c/cc533a2ffaa6749722ea87039d93a215fb46b246.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/t9xIuyPgDodaY9bEkF0sC6XorBQ.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"gov\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex023/uploads/cardano/optimized/3X/c/c/cc533a2ffaa6749722ea87039d93a215fb46b246_2_1000x562.jpeg\" alt=\"gov\" data-base62-sha1=\"t9xIuyPgDodaY9bEkF0sC6XorBQ\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex023/uploads/cardano/optimized/3X/c/c/cc533a2ffaa6749722ea87039d93a215fb46b246_2_1000x562.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex023/uploads/cardano/optimized/3X/c/c/cc533a2ffaa6749722ea87039d93a215fb46b246_2_1500x843.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex023/uploads/cardano/original/3X/c/c/cc533a2ffaa6749722ea87039d93a215fb46b246.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E1DEE5\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003egov\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1600×900 129 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eScaling Global Adoption: Orion Fund Progress Update and Q\u0026amp;A\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Cardano Foundation, Draper Dragon, and Draper University invite DReps and the Cardano community to a progress update session on the Orion Fund.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis session offers an operational update on the fund’s setup, recent ecosystem initiatives, and strategic roadmap, followed by an open Q\u0026amp;A with Samiz Bayan (Draper Dragon).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey Agenda Topics:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eStructural Setup:\u003c/strong\u003e Overview of completed administrative setup.\u003cbr\u003e\n• \u003cstrong\u003eBuilder Engine \u0026amp; Accelerators:\u003c/strong\u003e Updates on the Genesis Pre-Accelerator, Cometa Labs, and current applications open for the Apex Growth Accelerator\u003cbr\u003e\n• \u003cstrong\u003eInitial Investments \u0026amp; Outlook:\u003c/strong\u003e Highlights from the first portfolio investments and upcoming multi-month milestones.\u003cbr\u003e\n• \u003cstrong\u003eCommunity \u0026amp; DRep Q\u0026amp;A:\u003c/strong\u003e Dedicated 25–30 minute open Q\u0026amp;A session.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/apple/date.png?v=15\" title=\":date:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":date:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Monday August 17, 2026\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/apple/eight_o_clock.png?v=15\" title=\":eight_o_clock:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eight_o_clock:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e 19:00 – 20:00 JST / 12:00 – 13:00 CEST\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/apple/link.png?v=15\" title=\":link:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":link:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Session Details: \u003ca href=\"https://www.addevent.com/event/7gd7mvcrsd64\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eAddEvent\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the discussion below! We’ll update this thread with the recording link as soon as it’s live.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-12T08:33:41.500Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":16,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":158.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":156231,"topic_slug":"scaling-global-adoption-orion-fund-progress-update-and-q-a-17-august","display_username":"Cardano Foundation","primary_group_name":"cf-team","flair_name":"cf-team","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex023/uploads/cardano/original/2X/2/264e2dddc9d7b5d38a3eedc61d26807f2dc943ab.png","flair_bg_color":"fff","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":41,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.addevent.com/event/7gd7mvcrsd64","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"AddEvent","clicks":4},{"url":"https://forum.cardano.org/t/digest-august-19-2026-cardano-at-token2049-rare-evo-2026-recap-urgent-governance-call-to-action-rethinking-catalyst-funding-real-world-impact-tech-wins-cip-updates-and-more/156342","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Digest August 19, 2026: Cardano at TOKEN2049, Rare Evo 2026 Recap, Urgent Governance Call to Action, Rethinking Catalyst Funding, Real-World Impact \u0026 Tech Wins, CIP Updates, and more","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cardano.org/t/digest-du-19-aout-2026-cardano-a-token2049-recapitulatif-de-rare-evo-2026-appel-urgent-a-l-action-en-matiere-de-gouvernance-repenser-le-financement-de-catalyst-impact-concret-et-avancees-technologiques-mises-a-jour-des-cip-et-bien-plus-encore/156344","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Digest du 19 août 2026 : Cardano à TOKEN2049, récapitulatif de Rare Evo 2026, appel urgent à l’action en matière de gouvernance, repenser le financement de Catalyst, impact concret et avancées technologiques, mises à jour des CIP, et bien plus encore","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Cardano Foundation Team","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":1627